Why, you ask?

1887
02:15:58,400 --> 02:15:59,984
It's absurdly simple.

1888
02:16:00,152 --> 02:16:03,196
There is gold in your trunk. I want it...

1889
02:16:03,906 --> 02:16:05,990
...so I have killed you for it.

1890
02:16:09,328 --> 02:16:11,329
[BOTH GRUNTING]

1891
02:16:15,626 --> 02:16:17,835
Get away from Mr. Ewing or I kill you.

1892
02:16:18,003 --> 02:16:19,295
You!

1893
02:16:21,757 --> 02:16:23,257
AUTUA:
Mr. Ewing, Mr. Ewing!

1894
02:16:23,425 --> 02:16:24,759
Got to flush you out.

1895
02:16:25,344 --> 02:16:27,679
Come on, Mr. Ewing, come on!

1896
02:16:29,014 --> 02:16:30,890
[BOTH GRUNTING]

1897
02:16:46,365 --> 02:16:48,366
[AUTUA GROANS]

1898
02:16:55,749 --> 02:16:57,375
Die!

1899
02:17:02,214 --> 02:17:03,548
Die!

1900
02:17:07,594 --> 02:17:09,137
[EWING COUGHING]

1901
02:17:19,064 --> 02:17:22,066
[SCREAMING IN DISTANCE]

1902
02:17:27,740 --> 02:17:29,240
What was that?

1903
02:17:29,408 --> 02:17:31,367
Kona war cry.

1904
02:17:31,869 --> 02:17:33,244
Zachry!

1905
02:17:38,792 --> 02:17:40,293
Oh, no, no, Sonmi, no!

1906
02:17:41,295 --> 02:17:42,670
Zachry!

1907
02:17:49,386 --> 02:17:52,430
This is what the general
wanted me to see?

1908
02:18:03,525 --> 02:18:05,276
<i>FROBISHER:
The end rushes towards me.</i>

1909
02:18:05,611 --> 02:18:07,111
<i>Unable to eat or sleep.</i>

1910
02:18:08,405 --> 02:18:12,241
<i>Like Ewing, the mortal coil
has become a noose.</i>

1911
02:18:12,409 --> 02:18:16,078
[WOMEN SINGING
IN FOREIGN LANGUAGE]

1912
02:18:16,622 --> 02:18:18,831
<i>Would rather become music.</i>

1913
02:18:28,550 --> 02:18:32,094
They believe they are
going to Xultation...

1914
02:18:32,262 --> 02:18:35,264
...but they are not, are they?

1915
02:18:48,654 --> 02:18:49,654
Welcome.

1916
02:18:49,822 --> 02:18:51,823
[SPEAKS IN FOREIGN LANGUAGE]

1917
